> to the bottom of the pool), or only if the PC is
> burdened, or totally a mis-remembering, too.

emergency_disrobe() is the relevant function. It'll pick random items
in your inventory to drop until you're below Stressed (below Burdened
if punished); some items can't be dropped or removed fast enough (worn
amulets, rings, eyewear, armour other than non-cursed helmet or
shield, cursed loadstones, welded weapons). Gold will only be dropped
when there's nothing else left. If dropping everything you can still
leaves you too encumbered, you're out of luck.

